// 1-6: drive a yank platform over spikes, hack a door, pull up the wall. Spikes are back.
id l1-06
name 1-6 CHAIN OF COMMAND
tagline every permission, one after another.
bg hall
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main yank hack
mechanics current:3 pull:1 yank:1 hack:1
new -
portion 5 drive the platform over current
portion 5 hack the door
portion 5 pull up the wall
hardness 5
